  "releaseNotes": "Prevents duplicate credential validation during concurrent login submissions; normalizes login user/domain input consistently; maps the deprecated AD configuration value to the Novell LDAP-based ADCore provider and removes the native Windows AD login implementation; ADCore does not repeat a user bind after a fast-path failure and propagates unexpected operational failures. Builds for net8.0 and net10.0.",
